cation": "", "tagline": "☑ LLM |☑ CSS | ☑ All In Web 践行者", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/14ed/48e6/438369_mini.png?m=1748955348", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/14ed/48e6/438369_normal.png?m=1748955348", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/14ed/48e6/438369_large.png?m=1748955348", "created": 1566961594, "last_modified": 1748955348, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "zh3256", "last_touched": 1785129453, "title": "为什么现在 CLI agent 应用那么火， GUI 不好用吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229915", "created": 1785053658, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题，大家不喜欢好看的 GUI 应用吗？", "content_rendered": "<p>如题，大家不喜欢好看的 GUI 应用吗？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1785053658, "replies": 99, "id": 1229915}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "/static/img/node_default_large.png", "name": "ime", "avatar_normal": "/static/img/node_default_normal.png", "title": "输入法", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/ime", "topics": 186, "footer": null, "header": null, "title_alternative": "IME", "avatar_mini": "/static/img/node_default_mini.png", "stars": 67, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 925, "parent_node_name": null}, "member": {"id": 47049, "username": "libasten", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/libasten", "website": "https://www.feidaoboke.com", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f6d4baad62e4ee124d392af83650f37d?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f6d4baad62e4ee124d392af83650f37d?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f6d4baad62e4ee124d392af83650f37d?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1381994119, "last_modified": 1781158233, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "itskingname", "last_touched": 1785130437, "title": "2026 年过半了，你们现在在用什么输入法？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230002", "created": 1785114601, "deleted": 0, "content": "# PC:\r\n\r\n前一阵子用微软自带，后来因为手机端装了语言输入法更好的豆包，就想着 PC 同步，只是豆包一直没有 pc 版，就“退而求其次”装了微信输入法，只是他们宣传的主力功能“剪切板”同步，不知道为什么经常失效。\r\n我做初步琢磨，感觉是要 pc 和手机上两个输入法都在前台工作的时候，能同步，不然大概率手机上复制了东西 pc 上没收到，有时候又很意外，pc 上复制了大量的文本内容，在手机上不小心一下贴进去了。\r\n其实这两端同步，我用的最多的就是复制验证码。\r\n\r\n# 手机端\r\n\r\n我手机上高强度用了豆包，语音输入确实牛，但是没法和 PC 同步一直是痛点，经常和微信输入法来回切，但是微信输入法的语言总是差那么点劲。", "content_rendered": "# PC:<br /><br />前一阵子用微软自带，后来因为手机端装了语言输入法更好的豆包，就想着 PC 同步，只是豆包一直没有 pc 版，就“退而求其次”装了微信输入法，只是他们宣传的主力功能“剪切板”同步，不知道为什么经常失效。<br />我做初步琢磨，感觉是要 pc 和手机上两个输入法都在前台工作的时候，能同步，不然大概率手机上复制了东西 pc 上没收到，有时候又很意外，pc 上复制了大量的文本内容，在手机上不小心一下贴进去了。<br />其实这两端同步，我用的最多的就是复制验证码。<br /><br /># 手机端<br /><br />我手机上高强度用了豆包，语音输入确实牛，但是没法和 PC 同步一直是痛点，经常和微信输入法来回切，但是微信输入法的语言总是差那么点劲。", "last_modified": 1785119521, "replies": 88, "id": 1230002}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240224, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4504, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 317324, "username": "rpish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/rpish", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_mini.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_normal.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_large.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_xlarge.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_xxlarge.png?m=1778243617", "created": 1526717952, "last_modified": 1778243617, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "clemente", "last_touched": 1785130242, "title": "哪个城市生活成本低，适合搞 OPC？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229916", "created": 1785054299, "deleted": 0, "content": "在家乡小县城被查水表了，感觉有点可怕，想润到大城市了。\r\n\r\n想问问 V 友们，有什么推荐的地方吗？\r\n\r\n最好生活成本低一些，然后有 OPC 相关政策社区，想和志同道合的朋友一起搞项目玩。", "content_rendered": "<p>在家乡小县城被查水表了，感觉有点可怕，想润到大城市了。</p>\n<p>想问问 V 友们，有什么推荐的地方吗？</p>\n<p>最好生活成本低一些，然后有 OPC 相关政策社区，想和志同道合的朋友一起搞项目玩。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1785054299, "replies": 61, "id": 1229916}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11325, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2413, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 111002, "username": "Awes0me", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Awes0me", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_mini.png?m=1767670953", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_normal.png?m=1767670953", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_large.png?m=1767670953", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_xlarge.png?m=1767670953", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_xxlarge.png?m=1767670953", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9ad2/67ac/111002_xxxlarge.png?m=1767670953", "created": 1429013905, "last_modified": 1767670953, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "xxss0903", "last_touched": 1785130476, "title": "大家觉得的躺平就是完全不工作吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229894", "created": 1785048702, "deleted": 0, "content": "我一直觉得躺平是找个轻松的班上，或者开个小店（自己不坐班那种），每个月有个两三千利润就可以了。", "content_rendered": "我一直觉得躺平是找个轻松的班上，或者开个小店（自己不坐班那种），每个月有个两三千利润就可以了。", "last_modified": 1785116686, "replies": 58, "id": 1229894}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 23942, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3714, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 616423, "username": "bestacou", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/bestacou", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e3bcb0457f716802c9e0ba4b08856714?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e3bcb0457f716802c9e0ba4b08856714?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e3bcb0457f716802c9e0ba4b08856714?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1677595265, "last_modified": 1677595265, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "refear99", "last_touched": 1785129320, "title": "5 年 PHPer，现在学 Java 还来得及吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229977", "created": 1785085645, "deleted": 0, "content": "不是标题党，不是程序员小白。5 年 php ，今年被公司裁员了，出来一看所在地连岗位都没有了。现在正在努力的学习 java ，争取找到工作，但也是也怕自己努力错了方向，拉长自己的 gap 时长，希望可以得到各位大佬的建议，呜呜呜，别骂我，拜托了。\r\n（公司一直用的 PHP ）", "content_rendered": "<p>不是标题党，不是程序员小白。5 年 php ，今年被公司裁员了，出来一看所在地连岗位都没有了。现在正在努力的学习 java ，争取找到工作，但也是也怕自己努力错了方向，拉长自己的 gap 时长，希望可以得到各位大佬的建议，呜呜呜，别骂我，拜托了。\n（公司一直用的 PHP ）</p>\n", "last_modified": 1785120502, "replies": 55, "id": 1229977}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 23942, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3714, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 698558, "username": "Bullish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Bullish", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_mini.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_normal.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_large.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "created": 1719575876, "last_modified": 1760142421, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "anxiaodu666", "last_touched": 1785128821, "title": "那些中年失业的人都去干什么了？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229994", "created": 1785113060, "deleted": 0, "content": "叠甲：\r\n\r\n1 、不讨论那些能持续学习迭代跟上行业发展的人，这些人是不会失业的。\r\n2 、不讨论在失业时已经积累了足够现金储备等人，这些人是提前退休，不需要为生计奔波了。\r\n\r\n\r\n所以：互联网行业的这些产品、开发、设计等相关从业者失业后都干什么去了？", "content_rendered": "叠甲：<br /><br />1 、不讨论那些能持续学习迭代跟上行业发展的人，这些人是不会失业的。<br />2 、不讨论在失业时已经积累了足够现金储备等人，这些人是提前退休，不需要为生计奔波了。<br /><br /><br />所以：互联网行业的这些产品、开发、设计等相关从业者失业后都干什么去了？", "last_modified": 1785113060, "replies": 53, "id": 1229994}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9f61/408e/56_large.png?m=1628212285", "name": "internet", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9f61/408e/56_normal.png?m=1628212285", "title": "互联网", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/internet", "topics": 4207, "footer": "", "header": "In Internet we trust", "title_alternative": "Internet", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9f61/408e/56_mini.png?m=1628212285", "stars": 1203, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 56, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 239594, "username": "jacketma", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/jacketma", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a941f83ac4192740c2e1f95676ce23c5?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a941f83ac4192740c2e1f95676ce23c5?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a941f83ac4192740c2e1f95676ce23c5?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1499704166, "last_modified": 1770973638, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "gogozs", "last_touched": 1785130357, "title": "老罗吐槽给老太买了 2 个电视机不会用，还有更好的设计吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230034", "created": 1785118365, "deleted": 0, "content": "老罗给老太太买了 2 个智能电视机，老太太都不会用，只好换成电视盒子\r\n\r\n罗玉龙嘴真毒啊，吐槽电视剧产品经理上不了天堂😂\r\n\r\n现在的智能电视 os 本质上就是手机系统一样的，对老年人而言复杂度确实高了，并不友好。哪个年轻人没经历过给长辈教学如何实用手机呢\r\n\r\n老罗只管吐槽，自己设计个电视 OS 试试？也许，智能电视的本就不属于老人群体的消费品，上一辈的老人最适合的也许就是传统电视机。", "content_rendered": "<p>老罗给老太太买了 2 个智能电视机，老太太都不会用，只好换成电视盒子</p>\n<p>罗玉龙嘴真毒啊，吐槽电视剧产品经理上不了天堂😂</p>\n<p>现在的智能电视 os 本质上就是手机系统一样的，对老年人而言复杂度确实高了，并不友好。哪个年轻人没经历过给长辈教学如何实用手机呢</p>\n<p>老罗只管吐槽，自己设计个电视 OS 试试？也许，智能电视的本就不属于老人群体的消费品，上一辈的老人最适合的也许就是传统电视机。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1785118796, "replies": 50, "id": 1230034}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11325, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2413, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 411532, "username": "clacf", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/clacf", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1557638602, "last_modified": 1785117401, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "xiangran0028", "last_touched": 1785129338, "title": "懒人维持每天生活必须营养的做饭方式推荐", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230026", "created": 1785117779, "deleted": 0, "content": "早餐\r\n    鸡蛋 2 个\r\n    牛奶 300ml\r\n    吐司 2 片\r\n\r\n午餐\r\n    熟米饭 300g\r\n    鸡胸肉 200g\r\n    西兰花 300g\r\n\r\n晚餐\r\n    熟米饭 200g\r\n    鸡胸肉 150g\r\n    西兰花 200g\r\n    \r\n鸡胸肉直接煮熟了，改刀后，用平底锅煎，淋上生抽，撒盐。\r\n米饭一次性煮一个星期的量，用塑料袋分好饭团。\r\n西兰花放冷冻，可以保存一年。\r\n感觉这招的营养均衡，方便快捷，适合懒人维持生命体征。", "content_rendered": "早餐<br />    鸡蛋 2 个<br />    牛奶 300ml<br />    吐司 2 片<br /><br />午餐<br />    熟米饭 300g<br />    鸡胸肉 200g<br />    西兰花 300g<br /><br />晚餐<br />    熟米饭 200g<br />    鸡胸肉 150g<br />    西兰花 200g<br />    <br />鸡胸肉直接煮熟了，改刀后，用平底锅煎，淋上生抽，撒盐。<br />米饭一次性煮一个星期的量，用塑料袋分好饭团。<br />西兰花放冷冻，可以保存一年。<br />感觉这招的营养均衡，方便快捷，适合懒人维持生命体征。", "last_modified": 1785119543, "replies": 48, "id": 1230026}]